                  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> pimsii:msHPIPIRIP;
                  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#propertyChainAxiom> (pimsii:msHPHR
                                                                      pimsii:overlapsWith).
pimsii:msHPHRHR a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
