                                                                      pimsii:sharesRepresentamenWith).
pimsii:msHPIPIR a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                rdfs:comment "(X msHPIPIR Z) == hasProperPart o isProperPartOf o isRepresentamenFor == there is a Y such that (X overlapsWith Y) and (Y isRepresentamenFor Z)";
                rdfs:label "msHPIPIR"@en;
